    intro: 'The harness is everything around the model: the loop, the state, the retries, the stopping rule. These plates cover the architectures that recur in almost every production agent — from a single forward pass to systems that run for days, the ways several agents hand off, share state and argue, and the thinking budgets, routing and control surfaces that decide what any of them cost.',
